00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.000
judy: Right.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:46.000
Whitney Hodges: Oftentimes, what we see is when you have a really great foundation in place, like you already do, right, with the work that you've done with Emily on the website, um, with the organic SEO, I mean, the fact that you have 114 events on.

