00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.000
Whitney Hodges: Is.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:11:04.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah. Mm-hmm. Yeah. So, what we often see is when you have a great foundation like that, you can use paid digital advertising to really put fuel on the fire, right?

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.000
judy: Right, right.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:20.000
Whitney Hodges: So with the the paid Google ads. They're kind of a complement right to your your Google SEO, because, you know, you're already showing up organically for some keywords. People are finding you that way. But we can layer on.

