judy: Uh-huh.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:36.000
Whitney Hodges: paid search campaigns, right? To where, you know, there are additional keywords or other keywords that you are showing up for as well in the search results for high-intent users. And those may be, you know, keywords that you wouldn't have ranked high for organically.

