judy: Uh-huh. Right.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:53.000
Whitney Hodges: Or it could be that you're now gonna show up twice, right? You're… there's gonna be an organic listing people that see… people see, and the paid listing that people see, which really kind of, um, amplifies your authority, right? People are… they see you twice, right? It really kind of helps with that.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.000
judy: Right.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.000
judy: Mm-hmm.

