judy: Right.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:27.000
Whitney Hodges: find you who really have never heard of you before, right? Um, it's more kind of disruptor marketing, right? So it's like, as brides are just kind of like, you know, scrolling, they're going on social media to be entertained, the algorithm and the targeting of the ads, they're gonna understand.

