Whitney Hodges: these people are in market, right? And be able to serve your ads to them, right? And it can be, oh, Pecan Springs Ranch, what is this? I haven't heard of this before. Like, let me check it out. Let me learn more.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.000
judy: why they're seeing it.

