judy: Yeah. Yeah.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:13:00.000
Whitney Hodges: So there are ways on the meta ad side of things for us to really take what we call a full funnel approach, because we'll have certain ads that are targeted to completely cold audiences, right? So women getting married in the area who have never heard of you before, we want to get brand new eyes on the business every day.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.000
judy: Right, right.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:17.000
Whitney Hodges: And we can also have campaigns that are running specifically with the purpose of getting you more inquiries, you know, getting you more tours booked. And then we can also do retargeting ads, which are really wonderful. And so what that is, those are ads.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.000
judy: Yes.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:34.000
Whitney Hodges: that are specifically targeting people who have visited your website before, or have engaged with you on social media before. So, I'm sure you've probably experienced this, right? Where you go to a website, you're researching something, and then you go to your Instagram or your Facebook, and then you see an ad.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:24.000
judy: Oh…

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.000
judy: Mm-hmm.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.000
judy: Oh, yeah.

