judy: Right. That's what you're talking about.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:54.000
Whitney Hodges: Retargeting works. Yeah, so it really kind of creates this system where it all works together, right? Because if somebody finds you through, whether it be an organic or a paid Google search, and they go over to the website, but maybe they're not quite ready to inquire just yet.

