judy: Okay. Okay.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:22.000
Whitney Hodges: They get on Instagram or on Facebook. And so we find that that's really powerful, especially today's day and age, because there's so many distractions, right? There's so much going on in the world. We're being served so many messages, um, over and over from.

