Whitney Hodges: you know, all these different platforms and advertisers, um, that it's really important for a venue, especially, and especially in a crowded market, too, right? Really be able to, you know, repeatedly have touchpoints in front of these potential.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.000
judy: Right.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.000
judy: Yeah. Oh, yeah.

