00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.000
Whitney Hodges: I think.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:22.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, okay. Well, I'm happy to tell you more if you're interested. You know, there are, you know, quite a few venues, not necessarily in the Austin area. Actually, we're not, we don't currently have any other…

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.000
judy: Uh-huh.

