Whitney Hodges: Right?

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:45.000
judy: No, we're like, okay, well, we'll add you on, or, you know, okay, don't feel uncomfortable, or yes, I'll get on a call with you, and then I'll follow it up with an email, or something, yeah.

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:39.000
Whitney Hodges: Thank you.

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:47.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Yeah.

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:51.000
judy: Yeah, but I'm not seeing parents as involved anymore either.

00:31:47.000 --> 00:31:48.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Okay.

