Whitney Hodges: Yeah, I know it can change from venue to venue and market to market, honestly, too. But yeah, I think we are seeing a lot more of that of like, you know, couples really paying for their own weddings too, right? Or parents are contributing, but giving the money to the couple.

00:31:58.000 --> 00:31:59.000
judy: Oh.

