judy: Definitely. We definitely would be interested in knowing more about that too.

00:32:14.000 --> 00:32:16.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:32:20.000 --> 00:32:21.000
Whitney Hodges: Yes, ma'am.

00:32:21.000 --> 00:32:22.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

