judy: Oh.

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:01.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:17.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, but the direction that the industry is definitely moving in is price transparency. Um, and what we're hearing, right, is that a lot of, um, venues and vendors, you'll actually, like, miss out on inquiries if people don't have.

00:34:07.000 --> 00:34:08.000
judy: Uh-huh.

00:34:16.000 --> 00:34:17.000
judy: Because…

00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:22.000
Whitney Hodges: some indication of at least starting price point or average point.

00:34:20.000 --> 00:34:28.000
judy: Well, we have that, like, starting price point to our highest, but we don't have the actual pricing.

00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:24.000
