00:34:28.000 --> 00:34:29.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:34:28.000 --> 00:34:49.000
judy: Also, I tend to past year, so having to run like a special, you know, like you get an extra hour or you're going to get 10% off or like right now the rest of what dates are available in 26 or 25% off, you know.

