Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:53.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:34:57.000 --> 00:34:59.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:34:58.000 --> 00:35:07.000
