judy: what season it is, time of the year. Yeah.

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:29.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah, no, I think as long as you have that, at least some transparency on starting price points, averages, things like that, that you should be okay, right? And typically in that first email that goes out, where I'm assuming that that's where you're kind of…

00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:25.000
