Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. Mm-hmm.

00:36:14.000 --> 00:36:17.000
judy: Is that something common now?

00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:28.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, and I would say I don't see a whole lot of venues that are including links to the availability calendar, in all honesty, in that first email. Um, and they're actually, you know.

